Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, I'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Release Mokuba now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Disrespecting Mokuba again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting like his opinion means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Moki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Kyber Corp to Noah now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Mokuba has made\Nhis position quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, are you going to attack me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, just remember\Nyou'll be striking Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Seto, attack and\Nyou'll win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.61,0:01:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a no-brainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has to attack him and win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If he lets Noah win, then we all lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your victory or Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, I knew you were too weak\Nto go through with your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly run a company\Nlike Kaiba Corp effectively
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're so quick to give\Nin to your competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for a better brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's finish this\Nstranger off, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This creep doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the voice, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For it's time for you to experience\Nanother of my Deckmaster's special skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe as I unleash Shinato's\NArk's greatest power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Restoration of life! Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster in the car\Ngraveyard is now aboard my ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,giving it a grand total\Nof 12 passengers. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I choose to\Nremove Every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:02:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster that I obliterate\Ntransfers its power to my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,making me unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I get a 500-point\Nboost from each monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I receive 6,000 more life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm even stronger\Nthan I was when we began.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never beat us now, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with a mere 700 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack and Kaiba's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Noah wins this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll take over Kaiba's body and escape\Nto the real world to run Kaiba Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving the rest of us trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That virtual jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Dark Hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card destroys\Nall monsters in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what happens\Nto them after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They become passengers\Naboard Shinado's Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah just filled his ship\Nup with monsters again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:04:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he has even more\Ncreatures he can call on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, he can boost his\Nlife points even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Mokuba be\Nforced to turn against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I have been too hard on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you betray me? Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell Gozaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, we're a team, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never turn my back on you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm giving my\N2% of Kaiba Corp to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We defeated our stepfather together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Very touching, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mokuba's on my team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And together, we're going\Nto take everything you have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's my brother He doesn't even\Nremember you Kaiba, listen to me No thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Because I've been through\Nthis before Remember when
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was brainwashed by Merrick\NAnd he turned against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can get through\Nto Mokuba. The same way I
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,got through to Joey The\Nanswer may be in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a duel to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only am I planning to win this\Nduel, I'll also win back my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have this card,\NDifferent Dimension Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll switch it into\Ndefense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can get past this, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, it's time for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll warm things up a bit\Nand put an end to the Ice Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this is my virtual world,\Nand I control everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, the fall of the Ice Age\Nopened the way for the rise of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, cities grew and large\Ncorporations controlled the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since that's your company,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe you'd like to\Nsee it one final time. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,once you lose and I take over Kaivacorp,\NI'll change it back to the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't remember, this\Nshould refresh your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like so many of the\Nhigh-tech battle vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that were produced by\Nthe original Kaivacorp,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My Cards Flyer can cause an\Nenormous amount of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll add this to boost its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Cyclone Laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And to make my jet even\Nstronger, I'll add one more card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Matter Leveler Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It increases the overall\Nattack strength of my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards Flyer by 100 points\Nevery time it blasts you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my laser's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose life points even though\Nyour monster's in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards, attack his dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With Cyclone Blast Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And since your dragon returns to\Nthe field every time it's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.73,0:07:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can keep attacking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What was once your monster's\Nadvantage is now your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He does have a point there, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Kaiba draws a powerful monster,\Nhe can still turn this duel around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave my different dimension dragon\Nin defense mode and end my turn now That's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:08:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the move of a man who's given up I knew\Nyou were no match for my superior mind and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,once I defeat you everyone else will know\Nas well Then I'll finally be able to run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber Corp as I was\Nalways meant to you may
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Control this little virtual fantasy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no way you'll\Nmake it in the real world Noah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of what it's\Nlike in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And after ruling this digital universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that running\NKaiba Corp will be a simple task.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And one that I was raised\Nto do for my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is until you came into my home\Nand took everything away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's my turn to\Ntake everything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I took your brother, and\Nnext I'll take your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get back to this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card, Gradius' option!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I already have one Cards\Nfighter jet on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,this card creates a second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the power of two\Nunstoppable aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Cyclone Laser, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep this up much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy will soon be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're enjoying\Nthe show. Hmph! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it feel to lose your only friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get back to your\Ndestruction, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Cyclone Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his dragon now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the mighty Seto\NKaiba now. Snap out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I need you in order to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one attack away from total\Nannihilation. I'm not done. Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Squash this kid It will take more\Nthan a few attacks to keep me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know that sometimes\Nit's best to stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner you give in to my power, the\Nless suffering you'll have to do, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba realized that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I know you're in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah is hypnotizing you with lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto is your brother, not Noah,\Nand he's never let you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look inside your heart and\Nyou'll remember him! Beto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just trying to\Nbreak us apart, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let Noah poison your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family and no one\Ncan ever change that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have always been there to\Nsupport one another and we always will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I've\Nnever told you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You once saved me when we were kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.01,0:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When Gozoforo Kaiba adopted\Nus, he was merciless,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing me to work for hours with no rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was exhausted and ready to give up\Nuntil you inspired me, Mokuba. My deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're not the greatest\Ncards, but they're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba made me a Blue Eyes card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,By making that card for me, you\Nencouraged me not to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me something to strive for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore that day to become a person\Nworthy of possessing a real blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember making that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew how much Seto wanted that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought if I drew one for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd always remember his dream\Nof owning a real one someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I secretly dreamed that\NSeto and his blue eyes would
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,fly me as far from my\Nstepfather's house as we could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can't forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong, and I know you\Ncan break through his mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And never let anyone control you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up! Fight him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this, you and I, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let this be the card I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll activate the special\Nability of my Deck Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.31,0:12:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I only need to sacrifice one\Nmonster so that I can play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the incredible power\Nof my blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the monster I drew for Seto,\Nthe one that he always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best to help him get\Nit, and now, thanks to my health,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he has one in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's back with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And once he steps away,\NKaiba can blast Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, you phony!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon,\Nattack his Blue-Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's out of monsters now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba knew that destroying\None of Noah's jets
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,would automatically destroy the other one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:13:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't celebrate just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still my deckmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinato's Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are five monsters on board\Nto increase my life points. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives him 2,500 more life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never go down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have you right where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to find out which\None of us is superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one turn left, so brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal the trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this, Moguva.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of us will pick a\Nmonster to keep on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and all others will go\Ndirectly to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the two chosen\Nmonsters will face each
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,other in a one-on-one\Nbattle to the finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When the fight is over, only one of\Nour monsters will remain standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this one battle will\Ndetermine who wins the entire duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how many life\Npoints he has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,May the strongest duelist win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose my Blue Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I choose my Deck Master,\Nthe all-powerful Shenado's Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to sink your\Nship now and finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon, attack his\NDeckmaster with White Lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Better abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba won! Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just unleashed a power\Nlike nothing you've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my real Deckmaster! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just sealed your own doom, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,For when you destroyed Shinado's Ark, you\Nreleased Shinado, king of a higher blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to experience the\Npower of my real Deckmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.65,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, I've finally done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've proven that I'm superior to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally take over\NKaivacorp like I was always meant to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For I am the most powerful\Nbeing in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to perform one final task\Nbefore I exit this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Dad Freak doing? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll now merge together with my Deck Master\Nto deliver the last blow of this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I've decided not to escape\Nto the real world in your body, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,since I have so many\Nothers to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got bigger plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinato and I want to turn you into a\Npermanent fixture in this virtual world. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This reunion is touching, but I'm afraid\NI'm going to have to cut it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My job is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought they were hard-headed, So\NI've turned them into a living sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so close, yet they'll\Nnever reach one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How tragic. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, you think this\Nproves you're the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it shows your\Nfather that you're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated Seto in this\Nduel fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think kidnapping Mokuba and\Nusing him as a shield is fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I cheated?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're guilty of the same foul\Nplay you once scolded the Big Five for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you said your\Nfather would never allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba could have easily\Ndefeated you, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But he chose the safety of his\Nlittle brother over his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And that makes Kaiba a stronger\Nperson than you will ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All you've proven here\Ntoday is that you're a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,weak little boy who needs\Nto cheat to get his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and as far as i'm concerned you didn't win
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel but i have a proposition for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has 400 life points left.\NLet me take his place so we
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,can finish this duel there in\Nsquare huh that could be the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,most foolish challenge i've\Never heard does that mean you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,accept or are you afraid i'll\Ndefeat you and prove once
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And for all that, you are weak,\NI'd be crazy not to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yuki don't be a doofus he's got\Nover 7 000 life points to your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Measly 400. Careful, Joey's\Nright for a change. Once I defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you yuki i'll turn every one\Nof you into stone just try it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,i think we need a little privacy don't\Nyou what's he doing as i was saying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll turn all but one of you into stone\Nafter all i need a body to escape it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you lose, you'll set us all free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So in the name of Kaiba\Nand Mokuba, let's duel now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And may the best duelist win. You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, you and your friends\Nwill be prisoners of my world forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
